flowchart LR
  Chat[Existing Fred chat and evidence loop] --> Router[Model profile router]
  Router -->|gpt-6-astra| Adapter[Responses adapter: high reasoning, store false]
  Router -->|Other profiles| Existing[Existing provider API]
  Adapter --> Guard[Check for three identical tool rounds]
  Guard -->|No progress| Stop[Return clear stop; preserve earlier results]
  Guard --> API[OpenAI Responses: 8192 output tokens; no automatic retries]
  API -->|incomplete: max_messages| Stop
  API -->|Other incomplete or failed| Error[Return error; never execute partial tool calls]
  API --> Usage[Log tokens, reasoning, cache and duration per turn]
  API --> Results[Text and function calls]
  Results --> Chat
  Chat --> Handlers[Existing authorized tool handlers]
  Handlers -->|Tool results and retained reasoning| Adapter
  Chat -->|CIO requested change| Workspace[Editable development workspace]
  Workspace --> Validate[Independent sandbox tests and builds]
  Validate -->|Exact passed revision| Publish[Protected release controller]
  Publish --> Drift[Compare live model and loop-control hashes]
  Drift --> Backup[Back up source and bundles]
  Backup --> Deploy[Deploy and restart]
  Deploy --> Health[Independent health checks]
  Health -->|Failure| Rollback[Restore previous release]
